      "id": 30,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## Manual Scan Commands\n\n### Trigger an immediate Prowler scan:\n```bash\naws ecs run-task \\\n  --cluster $CLUSTER_NAME \\\n  --task-definition $ENVIRONMENT-prowler \\\n  --launch-type FARGATE \\\n  --network-configuration \"awsvpcConfiguration={subnets=[SUBNET_ID],assignPublicIp=ENABLED}\" \\\n  --region eu-west-1\n```\n\n### View latest scan results in S3:\n```bash\naws s3 ls s3://prowler-results-$ENVIRONMENT-$ACCOUNT_ID/prowler-results/$ENVIRONMENT/ --recursive | tail -10\n```\n\n### Download latest scan report:\n```bash\naws s3 cp s3://prowler-results-$ENVIRONMENT-$ACCOUNT_ID/prowler-results/$ENVIRONMENT/$(date +%Y%m%d)/ ./prowler-report/ --recursive\n```",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.0.0",
      "title": "Manual Commands",
      "type": "text"
